      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not easily.  I went through all the hpd_update board settings and there are two cases that would make this difficult:\n1.  A few boards actually use a board.c function for this (octopus ITE boards, the kukui family)\n2.  A lot of boards use ps8xxx_tcpc_update_hpd_status specifically for HPD, but tcpci_tcpm_usb_mux_driver for their general usb_mux driver.  I would guess this is because the ps8xxx_usb_mux_driver looks like it\u0027s only for mux-only applications",
